<title>JAPAN: BOXING-ESPINOSA RETAINS WBC FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-ESPINOSA RETAINS WBC FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>FUKUOKA, Japan 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luisito Espinosa of the Philippines stopped Japanese challenger Nobutoshi Hiranaka with an eighth-round technical knockout on Saturday to retain his World Boxing Council (WBC) featherweight title.</p>
</text>
